{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33199","headline":"贺襄阳副使节判同加章绶 · 徐商","name":"贺襄阳副使节判同加章绶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱紫花前贺故人，兼荣此会颇关身。\n同年坐上联宾榻，宗姓亭中布锦裀。\n晴日照旗红灼烁，韶光入队影玢璘。\n芳菲解助今朝喜，嫩蘂青条满眼新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}